{"term":"specify","senses":[{"id":"kaikki:993a8d43bf1193055b","definition":"To state explicitly, or in detail, or as a condition.","example":"I was nevere somouned, ne never hadde tydynges of this matier but by seyd lettres and other fleying tales that I heve herd sithen, ne nevere hadde to do more with the seyd John Wortes than is specified in the seyd instruccion.","pos":"verb","synonyms":["name"],"antonyms":["generalize"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"transitive","wordFamily":["above-specified","misspecify","overspecify","prespecify","respecify","specifiability","subspecify","underspecify","unspecify"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/specify#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:a3666ce200fb9053b1","definition":"To include in a specification.","example":"It seems to me that whoever at the Department of Transport or the train operating companies, or both, is specifying the standard of seats these days has taken leave of their senses and opted for cheapness over comfort.","pos":"verb","synonyms":["explicitize","disambiguate","call","call out","clarify","clear up","get something straight","name","narrow down","nominate","particularize","singularize","specialize","specificate"],"antonyms":["generalize"],"collocations":[],"usage":"","register":"transitive","wordFamily":["above-specified","misspecify","overspecify","prespecify","respecify","specifiability","subspecify","underspecify","unspecify"],"source":"English Wiktionary via Kaikki.org","attribution":"English Wiktionary contributors","sourceUrl":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/specify#English","license":"CC-BY-SA-4.0"},{"id":"kaikki:4e761ccc37e429e7b3","definition":"To bring about a specific result.","example":"","pos":"verb","synonyms":["explicitize","disambiguate","call","call out","clarify","clear up","get something straight","name","narrow down","nominate","particularize","singularize",